    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1584cea28f756db",
      "translationZh": "过去几年里，扩展稠密语言模型的规模推动了大语言模型（LLM）领域的大部分进展。从早期的模型，如最初的 ULMFiT（约 30M 参数）或 GPT-2（1.5B 参数，在当时被认为“危险到不能发布”🧌），一路发展到如今拥有数千亿参数的系统，方法很简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c44a41cbe856e78",
      "translationZh": "更多数据 + 更多参数，带来更好的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d71132908e6944",
      "translationZh": "缩放定律强化了这一趋势，但稠密模型的规模扩展存在实际限制：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "788608e51acf7a48",
      "translationZh": "训练成本越来越高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c6fc80bff2f3c91",
      "translationZh": "推理延迟增加。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55ba0d4c7591d294",
      "translationZh": "部署需要大量内存和硬件资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3297ee4a4e1eeeb7",
      "translationZh": "这正是混合专家模型（MoEs）登场的地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
